sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Pod External Interface
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>127.0.0.1:8080 HTTP
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>(HDF5/PVC or MariaDB)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus Scraper

    Note over Client, Storage: Inference Data Ingestion Flow

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Client->>KRP: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>KServe v2 Inference Payload
        KRP->>KRP: Authenticate Request<br/>(OpenShift RBAC)
        KRP->>TrustyAI: Forward to 127.0.0.1:8080<br/>(Authenticated)
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Reconcile by Correlation ID<br/>(Join input + output)
        alt PVC Storage (default)
            TrustyAI->>Storage: Write HDF5 file<br/>to PVC mount
        else MariaDB Storage
            TrustyAI->>Storage: INSERT observation<br/>TCP/3306 (optional TLS)
        end
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Ack
        TrustyAI-->>KRP: 200 OK
        KRP-->>Client: 200 OK
    end

    Note over TrustyAI, Storage: Periodic Metrics Computation (every 30s)

    rect rgb(245, 235, 255)
        loop Every SERVICE_METRICS_SCHEDULE (default 30s)
            TrustyAI->>Storage: Read stored observations
            Storage-->>TrustyAI: Observation data
            TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Compute fairness metrics<br/>(SPD, DIR)
            TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Compute drift metrics<br/>(KS, Jensen-Shannon, Fourier MMD)
            TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Publish as Prometheus gauges
        end
    end

    Note over Prometheus, TrustyAI: Prometheus Scraping

    rect rgb(235, 255, 235)
        Prometheus->>KRP: GET /q/metrics
        KRP->>TrustyAI: Forward (authenticated)
        TrustyAI-->>KRP: Prometheus metrics text
        KRP-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
    end

    Note over Client, TrustyAI: Explainability Request Flow

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Client->>KRP: POST /explainers/local/lime<br/>{model, data}
        KRP->>TrustyAI: Forward (authenticated)
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Read model observations
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Historical data
        TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Compute LIME explanation
        TrustyAI-->>KRP: Explanation result (JSON)
        KRP-->>Client: 200 OK + Explanation
    end

    Note over Client, TrustyAI: Health Check Flow

    rect rgb(235, 235, 235)
        Client->>KRP: GET /q/health/ready
        KRP->>TrustyAI: Forward
        TrustyAI-->>KRP: 200 OK (ready)
        KRP-->>Client: 200 OK
    end
